WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:10.258
Tools has a world clock for everywhere your pack goes, with a map of who's in daylight, and a converter for "what time is it there when it's this time here".

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:25.059
If you commute, the commute planner lists real airline flights to each trip's report and back home after it, for your top lines.

00:00:25.759 --> 00:00:30.967
Pay check shows what each trip and your whole line guarantee this bid period —

00:00:30.967 --> 00:00:34.974
the floors you're paid to however the month actually flies —

00:00:34.974 --> 00:00:38.046
with the contract section each one comes from.

00:00:38.046 --> 00:00:49.063
If a trip got rebuilt or cancelled and you were paid less than it guaranteed, enter what you were paid, and it drafts a pay claim for you to check and file yourself.

